{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S01-0-0\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"生气还是想念的分辨，正落在对旧日生活失去后的空落与不知所失上。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S01-1-0\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"挺直背脊、不肯倒下，也正是离开熟悉生活、拒绝继续委屈自己的尊严感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S01-2-0\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"记忆清晰却无法拥有，直接对应意识到从前的日子已经回不去。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S02-2-0\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"不肯认输的反抗与提醒自己不能再受气的自我控制可以同时存在。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S03-0-1\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"曾经的温柔让人心颤，也正是后来怀念转为酸楚、意识到距离的原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S03-1-0\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"越怀念越感到遥远，既属于后来的酸楚，也落在此前想起亲近时光的短暂欢喜里。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S04-1-0\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"美好回忆之所以刺痛，正因为那是前一组真正盼望能够延续的亲近。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S05-0-2\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"对过去的眷恋与失落，直接落在意识到自己已经不在那些人身边的难受上。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S06-0-0\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"从前不用防备的亲近，正是如今独自面对生活时最怕再也得不到的东西。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S07-1-1\",\n      \"also\": 2,\n      \"why\": \"想冲出去却找不到出口，正体现了想找回亲近又不愿重新忍受委屈的两难。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S07-2-0\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"越熟悉越看见失去，直接解释了离开后为何会感到孤单并怀疑当初的选择。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S08-1-0\",\n      \"also\": 0,\n      \"why\": \"刚认出又退去的安静，正是想起旧日亲近时短暂重新获得的暖意。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S10-1-0\",\n      \"also\": 2,\n      \"why\": \"走了这么久仍然没有答案，直接对应反复思量却无法安顿眼下生活的困境。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S10-1-1\",\n      \"also\": 2,\n      \"why\": \"疲倦到不想再讲述，正是长期反复思考仍得不到答案后的耗竭。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S11-0-1\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"害怕仍在却继续向前，正对应担心以后独自面对困难却不收回眼下打算。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S12-0-1\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"不假装没有受过伤，正是能够不责怪自己离开、也不为陪伴重新忍让的前提。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"chunk\": \"S13-0-1\",\n      \"also\": 1,\n      \"why\": \"兴奋到顾不上喘息，不仅是怀念带来的激动，也对应想把往后的日子好好过起来的劲头。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7480acef-44be-43e1-9c4f-6b81fc22f770", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T140331874311Z", "elapsed_seconds": 395.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T14:10:07.687479+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ee693aded5179ab2cd5f3a38d6ad39e101a7fdc3a0650cce147c1893a8b9a28e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc42